WEBVTT

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.260
We will be entering the airspace above the site shortly.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.720
What is the situation there?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.550
Enemy clan confirmed.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.470
Special Police Force has also arrived at the scene.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.350
Roger that.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.390
Now infiltrating site airspace.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.770
Alert Special Police Force to be on their guard.

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.770
Copy that.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.110
Target confirmed.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:50.020
Shall we make a descent?

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.440
No, that's not necessary.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:11.000
That group is nothing but trouble.

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.380
Captain! Please let us land first!

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:22.770
It would be rude to keep the Red King waiting.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.770
The rest of you, please return to base.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.750
Unbelievable...

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.540
He just dropped in from the sky.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:52.090
Talk about making a grand entrance...

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:57.590
Third King Suoh Mikoto...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.310
Your actions are wild and chaotic as usual.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:06.180
Fourth King Munakata Reisi...

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:10.100
Your face looks awful and annoying as usual.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.360
Let's have some fun, Misaki!

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:21.370
Nice kick and nice catch!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.050
Burn them.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:46.270
No blood! No bone! No ash!

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.980
We will advance with sword in hand!

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.020
For our cause is pure!

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.230
Men! Draw your swords!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.110
Akiyama, ready!

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:56.070
Benzai, ready!

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:56.940
Kamo, ready!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.030
Domyoji, ready!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:58.950
Enomoto, ready!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:02:59.780
Fuse, ready!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:00.610
Goto, ready!

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.610
Hidaka, ready!

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.200
Fushimi, ready!

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.410
Awashima, ready!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:13.000
Munakata, ready!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.340
Totsuka...

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.340
You got it.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.470
Let's go, Anna.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.010
Mikoto...

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:38.150
Your reckless use of power is incurable.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.240
I don't need a lecture.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.780
Then I shall stop you with force!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.700
Fine with me, Munakata!

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:50.540
Let's see you handle this... Suoh Mikoto!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.090
I know you can do better than that!

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.720
That flame...

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:08.760
is quite impressive.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.270
However...

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:16.900
Mikoto-san!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.070
Saruhiko!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:24.660
Come here and play, Misaki!

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.990
I'll play with you, but don't start crying when I plaster you!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.080
Over here, you damn Monkey!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.960
You are going down today, you traitor!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.590
Sounds interesting!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.340
Let's see you try, Misaki!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.680
As if that'll work!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.850
You are wide open.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.440
What's wrong? You look pretty rusty.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.600
Shut up!

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.940
Time to end this.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.610
I'm done with you. Why don't you take a nap there?!

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.580
This is nothing!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.500
Better watch out, or you're gonna get it!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.960
See! You're not paying attention!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.130
Misaki...!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.550
Oh, I'm very sorry.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:30.300
I'm in a hurry. Excuse me!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.180
Hey, look out! That was dangerous.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:33.980
Sorry for scaring you!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.310
Daddy, look! Look!

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.940
Well, that was a fancy move.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.310
Uh-oh, heads up!

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:49.780
Oops... I overdid it.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.410
Sorry, Seri-chan.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.580
I didn't mean for that to happen.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.460
What's so funny?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:10.390
Don't underestimate SCEPTER 4, HOMRA!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:21.940
Come!

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.400
Okay, let's get on with it.

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:26.610
I'll handle this one!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.660
Man, this really pumps me up!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.030
Submit to arrest!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.540
If you stand in my way, I'll blast you away!

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.210
Here I come, you damn Blue!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.500
You're pretty fast for a big guy!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.460
Time for me to cut loose!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.840
You sound like you'd be better off joining our side.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:49.380
Headhunting me? Thanks, but no thanks!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.930
You're not strong enough to bring me down.

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.560
Heh... I guess I'll show you my cool moves!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:06:59.890
That was close!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.650
Stay back. I'll deal with him.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.070
Don't worry, Anna.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:08.650
Looks like everyone's having a great time tonight.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.740
But they're fighting...

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.820
True...

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:16.330
But doesn't it also look like they're dancing?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.620
See? Like this butterfly.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.880
So pretty...

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:34.100
The Dresden Slates...

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.850
A mysterious relic that selects seven Kings

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:39.180
and bestows them the
Sword of Damocles and its great power...

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:44.940
Carried into the country by
Kokujoji Daikaku at the end of World War II,

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.480
the slate has brought forth unprecedented prosperity

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.570
to post-war Japan.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.280
Every so often, a new king is selected...

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.370
Some lived to wield its power...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.200
While others chose to die and leave this world...

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.960
And then others who chose to watch over...

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:07.920
And now, at the end of these passing days...

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:14.180
A peculiar bond will bring the kings' paths into one...

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.500
High Score Kill... Found ya!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.260
By authority of J-Rank.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.930
Launch Mission 2086.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.060
Voiceprint verified.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:03.680
Mission 2086 authorized by J-Rank...

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:04.640
Activate!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:09.650
Thanks!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.860
Hey, Kurosuke... When are we gonna eat?

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.240
Wow!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.030
What is this? A bird?

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.330
Can't eat it...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.040
Hey!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.880
Target acquired. You've earned 100 JUNGLE points.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.430
How's that incident report
from the other day coming along?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:42.770
I'm putting it together right now, but I don't know...

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.270
Damn, I'm exhausted.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.190
Back to home base at last.

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.520
You can say that again.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.610
It's been like this everyday.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:51.650
Domyoji-san, a hard day's work, huh?

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:54.530
Yeah, I'm beat, Hidaka.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:59.200
Domyoji, Kamo... You've been
sent out two days in a row?

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.660
That's tough.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.790
Yeah. You guys too, right, Akiyama and Benzai?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.120
This was my third day.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.040
And it's Akiyama's fourth.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.670
We just got back and managed to
take a shower and change.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.970
Can't help it with all these incidents.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:20.340
Enomoto, Fuse...

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.890
Any leads on the whereabouts of Yatogami Kuroh

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.810
who was caught up in that explosion?

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.350
Not a clue.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:32.900
Fuse pressured that informant really hard, but...

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:36.780
I get the feeling that he's gone into hiding

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:39.320
with that girl partner of his.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.070
I'm not surprised.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:46.450
The Green Clan seemed to target him in particular.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:50.960
Well, anyway, there are incidents
happening all over the place

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:52.710
and we can barely keep up.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:58.090
Goto, what do you suppose the Green Clan is up to?

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.340
I have no idea.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.470
Are you guys stupid?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.560
Their top Clansmen aside,

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.770
those foot soldiers aren't thinking of anything.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.600
Huh? What do you mean, Fushimi-san?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.940
Thank you.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.280
Let's see...

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:21.360
"Yes! Now I'm in N-Rank!"

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:26.120
"I'm gonna keep earning points and get more power."

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:28.830
Fushimi-san, what is this?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:35.630
"Mission: Keep bullying the Black Dog.
Keep toying with the Blues."

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.760
It's the underground website for
users from JUNGLE, the Green Clan.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:45.100
To them, this is just a big game.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.520
It appears the Green Clan is giving us quite a hard time.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.480
Yes, much to our dismay...

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:58.030
They're using a very advanced tool
that keeps them anonymous on the Net,

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:01.400
to orchestrate incidents all across
the city, like it's just for fun.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:04.240
Last night, in the midst of
our investigations in Shizume,

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:08.040
we had an encounter with the Red Clan that ended in a stare-down.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.870
Is something wrong, Captain?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.920
So... They still had that option...

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.130
It's their way of harassing us.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.550
Awashima-kun, I want you to contact

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.760
the Red Clan and please do it as quickly as possible.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:28.510
Yes, sir.

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:36.230
Hey, Yata-san... Looks like Anna fell asleep.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.820
Guys... Don't just stand there.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:44.240
Put a blanket on the little lady.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.000
Yeah, it is getting pretty chilly these days.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:58.590
Chitose... I heard you and Dewa had a scuffle with the Blues last night.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:03.840
Oh, that was just a run-in with the pretty lieutenant.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:07.180
I guess they wanted to save face.

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.260
But they were on our turf...

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.850
so we couldn't back down.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:16.350
In the end, Kusanagi-san stepped in to bring things under control.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.860
I see.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:21.690
Eric and I also came close to clashing with the Blues.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.450
At least it didn't blow up into something bigger.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:30.240
Those Blues have been on constant
alert lately and keep poking around.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.040
You guys too?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.420
Hey, San-chan... What're you up to?

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.620
Hmm?

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.340
I've been noticing a lot of activity on the Net.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.340
Hey, what is this?!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.510
What is it, Shohei?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.180
Take a look.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:50.510
What's up?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.760
What's with the scary faces?

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:59.400
Hi there!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.190
Hey, sorry about yesterday, Seri-chan.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.400
I'll make it up to you next time...

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.880
Yeah, I know.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.090
We're supposed to toy with the Blue King

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.720
who has the Slates to the point of exhaustion,

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:31.010
and to also bully the Silver Clan

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.220
so we can get their king to
come out from hiding, right?

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:38.270
So I thought, why not make things more exciting

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.730
by having the Red Clan join the event?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.020
Yup, already gave out the orders...

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:45.980
...Nagare.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.110
Damn!

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:52.830
That was the one thing you bastards
weren't supposed to disrespect!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.620
You won't get away with this!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.880
Those days were precious to me!

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:23.150
This place is... from that time...

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.830
Oh, it's you...

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:37.200
What are you doing here, Saruhiko?!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:41.000
You identified the source of the feed too, right?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.330
The address of this building was conveniently

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.840
encrypted into the message.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:50.130
You idiot. This is a trap.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.550
I bet Kusanagi-san was the one who actually figured it out.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:58.930
So you heard the location and rushed out all alone...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.940
Right, Misaki?

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.020
Shut up...

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:07.320
I'm following Kusanagi-san's directions.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:10.780
The rest of HOMRA will be here soon.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.110
We know this is just to lure us.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:16.330
But a lead is still a lead.

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:19.450
Isn't that why you're here too?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.460
Say, Saruhiko...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.500
That time...

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:31.630
thanks to you—

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:36.010
All this fuss over some stupid video.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:39.100
Monkey, what did you just say?!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:43.100
Oh? Am I wrong?

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.850
It's stupid, plain and simple.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:46.980
Take it back.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.480
Stop being such a fool...

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:51.610
Take it back...!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.700
Suoh Mikoto...

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.950
...is dead. He's gone!

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.240
Monkey! Take it back!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.630
Yata, that's enough!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.720
Fushimi, stand down!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.930
Unwanted interference.

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.220
Monkey, you had a narrow escape, eh.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.640
My, my...

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.850
You all seem quite upset...

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.690
Aren't you, HOMRA?

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:31.360
Damn right!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.990
Mikoto-san and Totsuka-san were slandered!

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:37.570
We'll make 'em pay!

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.540
Kusanagi Izumo... We want you to back down.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:44.330
We will deal with the Green Clan.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:48.210
Sorry, Lieutenant Awashima...

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.380
But Yata's right.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.210
Those idiots have to find out the hard way

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:56.220
that messing with any of us means getting burned.

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.510
And I mean, literally...

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.600
That's the only way we HOMRA will be satisfied.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:09.190
If you put it that way, we've been taken for fools too.

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.360
This choice of place is no coincidence, don't you think?

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:17.280
They're here!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:21.200
Don't watch from behind the lines and show yourself.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.040
The bait was so obvious...

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.660
and you took it!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.250
Munakata Reisi, the Blue King...

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.840
100,000 JUNGLE points.

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.550
Kushina Anna, 100,000 JUNGLE points?!

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.970
Oh man!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:40.180
If we get them, we'll jump at least three ranks!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.970
Hey, the one with the big hooters is Awashima, right?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.180
She's worth 6,000 points.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:49.810
And that guy with the shades,
Kusanagi, is worth 6,000 too?

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:53.440
Also 4,000 for Fushimi and 3,000 for Yata.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:58.610
So anyway, we have nothing against you guys...

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:01.110
but it's all for the points.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.740
So die for us, will ya?

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.310
What's going on?

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.560
Why aren't they dead?!

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:31.690
Such a vile and disgusting sedition.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.230
Our lock-up is not what you call comfortable.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.690
I hope you're prepared.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:41.780
You said HOMRA is dead?

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.450
Don't you know?

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.410
We have a new king.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:49.960
A strong king who rivals Mikoto.

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:54.960
You laughed... at the lives that
Mikoto and Tatara lived.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.590
I won't forgive you.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:08.100
Shall we begin then?

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.310
For our cause is pure!

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.020
Men! Draw your swords!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.190
Yes, sir!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.270
Akiyama, ready!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.020
Benzai, ready!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:16.650
Kamo, ready!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:17.230
Domyoji, ready!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:17.900
Enomoto, ready!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.650
Fuse, ready!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.320
Goto, ready!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.030
Hidaka, ready!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.450
Munakata, ready!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.250
Time for us too.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.250
Don't let those Blues get all the credit!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.300
No Blood! No Bone! No Ash!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.050
Do not let the Red Clan outshine us!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.260
Leave this to me!

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:58.060
What is that?!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.150
What's going on?

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.700
What the hell was that? Are they like, monsters?

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.410
You two?!

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.910
We'd like to have a word with you.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:16.580
You won't get past us.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.920
Don't underestimate me!

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:20.590
I'm an N-Rank in JUNGLE!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:24.380
It's not just explosives. I have powers too!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:33.810
Okay now, I'm going to ask in order.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.520
Was it your king who ordered this assault?

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:42.820
Or... was it from one of your top
Clansmen, like Mishakuji Yukari?

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.820
What are your king's intentions?

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:47.950
And...

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:51.580
Do you know anything about
a guy named Isana Yashiro?

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.410
Damn it! Eat this!

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.380
Mission failed. Mission failed.

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:04.920
You have lost all JUNGLE points.

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.880
You will be stripped of all powers.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.510
No way!

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.930
After I worked so hard to earn those points?!

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:16.270
Damn it...

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:17.890
I'm an N-Rank.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:21.360
An N-Rank that was close to
talking with the king himself!

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:24.070
So how could this happen?!

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.410
You're done with him, Kurosuke?

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:31.950
He's just another expendable pawn.

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:34.410
He probably knows nothing.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:40.420
So no one knows Shiro's whereabouts?

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:44.420
Are you worried?

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:46.420
Nope.

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:49.300
He's our Shiro.

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:51.720
I know we'll see him again!

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:56.100
We just have to search harder and harder, that's all!

00:22:57.730 --> 00:22:59.890
Things are getting pretty interesting

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:03.360
thanks to those losers we threw in, Nagare.

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:08.450
It sucks that we weren't able to lure out the Silver King...

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:15.120
But the Blue King... He's running out of time.

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:26.590
Lieutenant...

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:30.130
Just as you did, I will move
forward until my very last breath...

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:33.680
I won't run away this time.

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:36.140
I will face it head on.

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:40.640
It's the second time I'm descending the sky.

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:45.480
But it's different from
the last time I was hurled down.

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:56.700
This time, I'm descending on my own free will.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:02.460
The Green rustles its malice as it takes root deeply

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:05.130
and extends its branches far and wide.

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:08.300
Meanwhile, SCEPTER 4 summons Kuroh,

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:10.220
and Neko makes a visit to HOMRA.

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:12.470
As they become targets of JUNGLE,

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:16.810
the two think of their missing king
and patiently waits for his return...

00:24:17.680 --> 00:24:21.100
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:23.770
#2 "Kindness".

00:24:23.770 --> 00:24:27.650
May those two be reunited with
the person they wish to see...
